  "description": "SuperRoad / endurance road design: The Motobecane Turino Expert XTL is built for fast road rides, commuting, fitness, rough pavement and light gravel use.\n\nIt combines a lightweight aluminum endurance frame, precision carbon fork, Shimano Claris compact double 2x8 drivetrain, mechanical disc brakes and 700x28c tires. The Expert frame/fork setup is road-focused but still allows wider tires, with the source spec listing 700x28c stock tires and fitment up to most 45c tires, while the fork spec lists a 700x45c max tire.\n\nThe compact 50/34T crank and 11-34T cassette give a practical climbing range without the extra complexity of a triple crank. XTL top-mount brake levers add another hand position for braking from the bar tops.",
